that's a little more
contemporary.

1517
01:23:53,612 --> 01:23:56,197
Ooh! Dang!
That's cool.

1518
01:23:56,782 --> 01:23:59,826
And Joe, we have a big
surprise for you.

1519
01:23:59,910 --> 01:24:00,910
What's up?

1520
